{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：22:18 2026-11-19 HKT<br/>發佈時間：22:18 2026-11-19 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：22:18 2026-11-19 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e69ed220d6b577c8b485588325e4cd45/2026-11/011_3.png\"/><p>今日（19日）傍晚6時許，警方接獲銅鑼灣勿地臣街1號時代廣場一間電器舖的負責人報案，指上址有61部相機及55個相機鏡頭不翼而飛，總值約188萬元，懷疑被一名年約40歲的男職員盜去。警方經初步調查，案件列盜竊，交由灣仔警區刑事調查隊第七隊跟進，暫未有人被捕。</p><img alt=\"據悉，現場為銅鑼灣時代廣場的豐澤。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0fb19304ebc45008e46a00f23484fa04/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-19_at_22_30_56_1_.jpeg\" title=\"據悉，現場為銅鑼灣時代廣場的豐澤。\"/><p>據悉，現場為銅鑼灣時代廣場的豐澤。</p><p></p><p></p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T14:58:56.435489+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":229,"images":2,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T14:18:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T14:52:22.651137+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T14:52:22.651137+00:00","content_hash":"4752b88bfc5bc88abc2a56acb77f725a2aa93ae3eba25ef88f9aaf320fe1b19a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}